00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:33.910
Episode 9: Umaru and Memories

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:33.870
So, how about I snap off a shot

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:33.870
while you just act natural?

00:02:33.870 --> 00:02:36.660
Huh? H-hold on, Big Brother!

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:44.620
Umaruuuun!

00:02:43.370 --> 00:02:44.370
Umaruuuu                                                             uuuun

00:02:44.620 --> 00:02:46.040
Okay, cheese!

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:47.660
How is that acting natural?!

00:02:47.660 --> 00:02:48.540
Tee-hee!

00:02:48.790 --> 00:02:52.660
If I'm gonna leave behind a memory of me,

00:02:48.790 --> 00:02:52.660
I may as well look good in it!

00:02:53.120 --> 00:02:56.200
She makes it sound like I'm painting her friggin' portrait...

00:02:56.660 --> 00:02:59.160
Oh, I know! I'll take YOUR photo!

00:02:59.660 --> 00:03:01.080
R-really?

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:06.290
It looks kind of plain...

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:07.580
Just hurry up and take it.

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:11.910
Come on, Big Brother! Give us a smile! Say chee...!

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:17.250
Hey! I was making some kind of weird face, wasn't I?!

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:19.250
Nah, not at all!

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:22.080
You friggin' took it when you'd only said "Chee"!

00:03:23.580 --> 00:03:25.540
Photos are a lot of fun, huh?

00:03:25.660 --> 00:03:26.500
Huh?

00:03:26.910 --> 00:03:30.290
Big Brother, there are some old photos in here.

00:03:30.500 --> 00:03:31.370
Huh?

00:03:32.790 --> 00:03:36.160
I guess Bomba left the memory card in, huh?

00:03:37.290 --> 00:03:39.450
Ah! Kirie looks so young!

00:03:39.450 --> 00:03:41.200
She doesn't look happy at all.

00:03:41.410 --> 00:03:43.950
And here's an old one of you!

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:45.660
Huh?

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:48.540
You shouldn't go looking at other people's photos.

00:03:50.870 --> 00:03:53.700
I'll give this memory card back to Bomba.

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:57.750
Still, finding old photos is kinda fun, huh?

00:03:57.870 --> 00:03:58.790
Yeah...

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:06.660
Okay, Big Brother! Let's take tons of pics!

00:04:35.160 --> 00:04:36.330
You're STILL taking photos?

00:04:36.620 --> 00:04:41.410
If I take photos of the hamsters,

00:04:36.620 --> 00:04:41.410
I might be able to enter them in a contest again!

00:04:41.870 --> 00:04:42.910
Oh, yeah.

00:04:43.910 --> 00:04:45.200
Okay, here goes.

00:04:49.750 --> 00:04:51.660
And... Cheese!

00:04:58.750 --> 00:05:02.620
Taihei, I bought a new camera,

00:04:58.750 --> 00:05:02.620
so I'll give you my old one.

00:05:02.620 --> 00:05:04.580
You wanna come by and get it tomorrow?

00:05:04.870 --> 00:05:09.040
But it's a single-lens, right?

00:05:04.870 --> 00:05:09.040
Don't you want to hold on to it?

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:11.290
You should have a camera.

00:05:11.290 --> 00:05:11.830
Huh?

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:17.580
Tanukichi will be all grown before you know it.

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:17.580
She won't be living with you forever, right?

00:05:18.290 --> 00:05:23.750
Take pictures of her now, while she's acting natural.

00:05:18.290 --> 00:05:23.750
You'll thank yourself for it later.

00:05:26.500 --> 00:05:31.080
Man, there's nothing more

00:05:26.500 --> 00:05:31.080
to take pictures of in here. Let's go outside!

00:05:31.410 --> 00:05:33.000
Hm? Oh...

00:05:33.250 --> 00:05:35.410
Well, how about we go for a walk?

00:05:41.580 --> 00:05:43.250
What do you wanna take a picture of, Big Brother?

00:05:44.830 --> 00:05:46.250
The scenery, I guess...

00:05:46.250 --> 00:05:47.160
Oh, yeah!

00:05:47.160 --> 00:05:47.580
Huh?

00:05:47.750 --> 00:05:51.000
Let's take a picture of you drinking cola

00:05:47.750 --> 00:05:51.000
with the setting sun in the background!

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:52.660
There's no point in even being outside for that, is there?!

